    Inherited Autopilot/allow-all state was not trusted: set and verified manual
    Agent policy before the prompt. Preserved saved grants/model; live approval
    prompting remains open. No new session, active attach or automatic retry.
  2026-11-11 - Verified the actual packaged capture/transcription/conversation/
    response/playback loop. Fixed the ordinary-reply parser rather than treating
    idle/process exit as success. No general tool or active-attach authority added.
  2026-11-11 - Owner designated an existing dedicated session for conversation.
    Corrected guessed CLI flags from installed help and qualified the exact
    conversation-only command. Added bounded host discovery/event correlation
    and cancellation. Broad capability and failure matrix remain open.
  2026-11-10 - Planned under documentation-only scope; execution not authorized.
  2026-11-10 - Refined proof criteria from deeper protocol/runtime research;
    no session catalog, live control or process execution tested.
